{"data": [{"author_id": "1426871362606440453", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:19:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114557412170686717"], "id": "2114557412170686717", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 233, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ネオクラウド株の命の選別が始まっています⚡\n\n借入が非常に厳しい状態✍️\n\n融資される会社\n\n融資されない会社\n\nこの差はなんでしょうね😊", "url": "https://x.com/c_hiikawa201751/status/2114557412170686717"}, {"author_id": "1799375232006078464", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:31:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114711541681676742"], "id": "2114711541681676742", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 384, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114705042817110293", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic 已向美国证券交易委员会（SEC）提交了与拟议首次公开募股（IPO）相关的注册声明。\n\nA社真得要准备上市了\n2万亿美元市值的超级巨头要来了\n\n我现在认为不可能加息了\n这么大的超级巨头上市，一定会尽量给够流动性的\n\n看看A社上市当日能有多少的市值\n而且A社融资有钱了\n直接大力投资数据中心！ https://t.co/IPdRLQXwoX https://t.co/SHCxz6Y2s0", "url": "https://x.com/mackpeterm88538/status/2114711541681676742"}, {"author_id": "2006357208251105280", "created_at": "2026-10-25T06:18:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114240061881696679"], "id": "2114240061881696679", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🇦🇺 Australia's Treasurer Jim Chalmers has warned that geopolitical shocks and fragile supply chains pose growing risks to the global economy.\n\nBut there's another question Australia must confront:\n\nAre our own economic and fiscal policies making inflation harder to control?\n\n📊", "url": "https://x.com/PWAW8db/status/2114240061881696679"}, {"author_id": "1816252584983945219", "created_at": "2026-10-25T01:49:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114172439609663656"], "id": "2114172439609663656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 207, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114171768630116700", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "為什麼央行降息，銀行的利差會越來越薄？\n你可能會想：「央行降息，不是存款和貸款一起降嗎？為什麼利差會縮小？」這正是資產負債表衰退帶來的特殊扭曲：\n非對稱降息與政策讓利： https://t.co/D8SkEabjne https://t.co/DqbdzgmDS5", "url": "https://x.com/HeyBlackjack21/status/2114172439609663656"}, {"author_id": "1516587386557579265", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:21:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114724047783424131"], "id": "2114724047783424131", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 128, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天下午五点四十五，央行发了一条公告，编号〔2026〕第12号。名字很长：债市非银大额赎回互换便利，英文缩写四个字母，BNSF。两百来字。我读了三遍，第一遍一个字没记住。", "url": "https://x.com/skyvivijun/status/2114724047783424131"}, {"article": {"title": "China's Central Bank Sets Up a Backstop for Bond Funds"}, "author_id": "1904953165696417795", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797021915738533"], "id": "2114797021915738533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The PBOC can now get liquidity to wealth-management and fund companies during a bond-market run. It is also preparing to make an overnight rate its main policy rate. https://t.co/FBdcDP3Apc", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaDistilled/status/2114797021915738533"}, {"author_id": "2032603036221165568", "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:15:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114465811364466862"], "id": "2114465811364466862", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114450024486633639", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "PBOC buying streak 🤯🤯🤯 https://t.co/n2Nw7jENAp", "url": "https://x.com/LucidGamblr7/status/2114465811364466862"}, {"author_id": "19399038", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:28:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114529644921655299"], "id": "2114529644921655299", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6254, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "PBOC sets USD/ CNY reference rate for today at 6.7162 (vs. estimate at 6.6691)\nhttps://t.co/u15Jua6D5a", "url": "https://x.com/investingLive_/status/2114529644921655299"}, {"author_id": "1677575083852955648", "created_at": "2026-10-24T23:22:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114135392287121510"], "id": "2114135392287121510", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 558, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113439295877046778", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "【速報】🇺🇸🇨🇳 中国人民銀行 (PBOC) 、人民元の対米ドル基準値を1ドル＝6.7180元に設定。 https://t.co/4ElUGcBYYy", "url": "https://x.com/MktBrain_US/status/2114135392287121510"}, {"author_id": "1966937657063141376", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:17:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114526819793973297"], "id": "2114526819793973297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 130, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC sets yuan midpoint at its strongest since Feb. 2, 2023", "url": "https://x.com/MarketsCapApp/status/2114526819793973297"}, {"author_id": "3229617158", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:01:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114568105850745312"], "id": "2114568105850745312", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "And how is it that the #US wants to compete with #China, whose (highest) hourly wage is USD4?\n\n#economics #finance #business #manufacturing #transport #industries #Fed #IMF #IBRD #EBRD #BIS #AMRO #AIIB #ADB #NDB #PBOC #ISDB https://t.co/HJMdXgnbDn", "url": "https://x.com/IngeniumAdvisor/status/2114568105850745312"}, {"author_id": "2098364902004166656", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:20:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114255844942721064"], "id": "2114255844942721064", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's broad spending fell ~4% yoy in September, the seventh straight monthly contraction, while revenue slipped negative for the first time since February. Fiscal support is fading just as income weakens, a risky mix. Fiscal impulse is fading, so growth leans on the PBOC. https://t.co/Tv19Kr5MR3", "url": "https://x.com/sorayaresearch/status/2114255844942721064"}, {"author_id": "1966937657063141376", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:21:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114527827869708765"], "id": "2114527827869708765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC injects 56 billion yuan via 7-day reverse repos at 1.40%, unchanged from prior 1.40%: statement", "url": "https://x.com/MarketsCapApp/status/2114527827869708765"}, {"author_id": "1968539598554009600", "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:37:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114456421530247302"], "id": "2114456421530247302", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Watching the PBOC quietly loosen while everyone fixates on Fed dots is the real tell. Rate differentials are drifting before the headlines catch up, and that's where the positioning edge lives.", "url": "https://x.com/Norman1527988/status/2114456421530247302"}, {"author_id": "1966937657063141376", "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:20:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114512352922243393"], "id": "2114512352922243393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet