57529664"], "id": "2114725553257529664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Onshore yuan hit 6.6682 per dollar, the firmest since June 2022, and is up 4.9% this year. The PBOC fixed at 6.7162, still 471 pips weaker than the model estimate. It is no longer resisting the rally. It is setting a speed limit. https://t.co/95OzPlTSz9", "url": "https://x.com/macro_soup/status/2114725553257529664"}, {"author_id": "305427771", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:27:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114680366263095647"], "id": "2114680366263095647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "JUSTIN: China keeps its benchmark lending rates unchanged for the 17th consecutive month! The one-year LPR remains at 3.00%, and the five-year LPR at 3.50%.\n\n最新消息： 中国连续第17个月维持贷款市场报价利率不变！一年期LPR为3.00%，五年期LPR为3.50%。", "url": "https://x.com/wangh920/status/2114680366263095647"}, {"author_id": "44531383", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:51:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114641130155307337"], "id": "2114641130155307337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨  Resumen de la transmisión en vivo de noticias de última hora del Sr. Miles Guo (5 de noviembre de 2022): Arresto de Fan Yifei; reemplazo de operadores en el extranjero para demostrar lealtad.\n\n 🔹  Fan Yifei, subgobernador del Banco Popular de China (PBOC), fue detenido por https://t.co/SHLckipSXW", "url": "https://x.com/FenixRojo_nfsc/status/2114641130155307337"}, {"author_id": "1856355605960654848", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:17:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114617488776261816"], "id": "2114617488776261816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3014, "like_count": 12, "quote_coun